      "description": "After `EVP_PKEY_assign_DH(peer_tmp, dh)` has already transferred the same `DH` object into `peer_tmp`, the shared error cleanup still frees the local `dh` alias. That leaves `peer_tmp` holding a dangling `DH *` that `EVP_PKEY_free(peer_tmp)` will free again."
